  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Tuberculosis Control Programme Conference for Programme Managers, 8-10 August 1999, 36 participants from Eastern Europe. The objective is to spread information and knowlegde to strengthen the efficiency of the National TB-programmes in the three Baltic States. The Swedish counterpart is the Nordic School of Public Health.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Tuberculosis Control Programme Conference riktad till programansvariga; 36 deltagare fr&#xe5;n &#xd6;steuropa, 8-10 aug 1999. Syftet &#xe4;r att sprida information och kunskap f&#xf6;r effektivisering inom de nationella TB-programmen i de Baltiska Staterna. Svensk samarbetspart &#xe4;r Nordiska H&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rdsh&#xf6;gskolan (NHV).</narrative>
